<p>Enter a state of heightened focus for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns. While in this state your ranged attack speed is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">11%, 20%, 25%, 28%, 30%,</acronym> your shots do not consume ammo, and all shots capable of marking have their chance to mark increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">21%, 32%, 39%, 45%, 49%.</acronym></p>